<title>CROATIA: Croatian M1 money supply, M4 rise in August.</title>
<headline>Croatian M1 money supply, M4 rise in August.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Croatia issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> CROATIA MONEY SUPPLY	    AUGUST	JULY	 AUG '95</p>
<p> Reserve money (million HRK)  7,995.8     7,706.0     6,231.5</p>
<p> Money M1 supply		 10,454.1    10,198.4     8,841.7</p>
<p> -Currency outside banks	4,069.0     4,001.0     3,273.0</p>
<p> Broadest money M4	     32,660.5    31,557.8    22,634.5</p>
<p>NOTE -- August reserve money rose 3.8 percent from July and 28.3 percent year-on-year. M1 was up 2.5 percent on a monthly and 18.2 percent on an annual level.</p>
<p>-- Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
</text>
